# KChart

- Read `docs/ai/index.md`, `docs/ai/chart-selection.md`, and `ai/catalog.json`.
- Use only factories exported by KChart public package entry points.
- Treat `recipe.*` ids as compositions, not import names.
- Validate provider output with `validateKChartAIPlan`.
- Never evaluate model-generated JavaScript or TypeScript.
- Keep realtime buffers bounded and destroy timers, workers, observers, and chart controllers.
- Dynamically import browser-only Three.js, CesiumJS, and MapLibre adapters in SSR applications.
- Run `npm run test:unit` after catalog, schema, series, or option changes.
